"moves from one part of the print to another. Appropriately configuring "
"pressure advance reduces the length of retraction required."
msgstr ""
"Die folgenden Standard-G-Code-Befehle stehen zur Verfügung, wenn der "
"[firmware_retraction-Konfigurationsabschnitt]"
